  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/u1lC7oT.png\" alt=\"Banner\" width=\"3000\" height=\"1482\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">Fusion Connected Blocks 為許多常見方塊（如拋光安山岩、鑽石方塊和書架）添加了連接紋理。</h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/LtHOSCD.png\" alt=\"Separator\" width=\"1042\" height=\"148\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">Fusion Connected Blocks 需要 <img style=\"width:1em\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/835/860/638227854854712053.png\" alt=\"Fusion logo\"> Fusion 才能正常工作。您可以點擊 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fusion-connected-textures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a> 或查看下方的圖片來找到 Fusion。</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fusion-connected-textures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/CelestialAbyss/badges/refs/heads/main/fusion/requires/compact_vector.svg\" alt=\"Requires Fusion\" width=\"364\" height=\"80\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/5d5A3W5.png\" alt=\"Separator\" width=\"1042\" height=\"148\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">如需未來內容、即將推出的模組以及討論，歡迎加入 SuperMartijn642 的 Discord 伺服器！</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/QEbGyUYB2e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/IG1us6p.png\" alt=\"Join SuperMartijn642&#x27;s Mods discord server\" width=\"373\" height=\"102\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/zaW7uNI.png\" alt=\"Separator\" width=\"1042\" height=\"148\"></p>",
